  "what_this_is": "Cell B4c of the SLURP v2 base program (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-16-slurp-v2-base-program-design.md section 4, an added one-factor separation of module M4a): the cell B0 review-off base with the intent-boundary knowledge store pinned to knowledge/slurp/semantic/intent-boundaries-v2 (docs/readiness/2026-09-17-slurp-semantic-store-revisions-v2-review.md, pins docs/readiness/2026-09-17-slurp-semantic-store-release-pins-v2.json) and NOTHING else -- no fallback candidate at any declaration site. It exists to separate the two halves of cell B4a: B4a moves the store revision and the standing general_quirky fallback hypothesis together, and if B4a is admitted this cell says which half carried it. Five of the sixty intent cards change (general_quirky, qa_factoid, qa_definition, general_greet, general_joke) with the one-directional qa/general contrast of FIX-2; every activation_boundary line, and therefore every retrieval key text, is byte-identical to v1, so the sealed SAEA-SLURP-INTENT-BOUNDARY-KEY-ENCODING-V1 facet vectors still bind, the selected facet ids stay the anchor's on every row, and only the rendered values of those five cards differ. This cell is registered at the LOWEST priority and carries no smoke of its own: its knowledge store, Perception retrieval geometry and prepared-supply inputs are cell B4a's, so the coordinator may reuse cell B4a's four-row smoke evidence as this cell's form evidence. Held identical to cell B0 otherwise: the roster and split, the model fragment and resident geometry, the promoted speech packets, the slot-contract store v1, the three-candidate / 28-value / 16-per-candidate candidate contract, every instruction template, the native episode role graph (review_loop off, two contacts per row) and the scorers. Fold B is absent. The review-off phase_tools block is carried verbatim and is inert: the review-off role graph builds no Reviewer node, so no tool action can ever be taken. It is kept because the arm speech-feature-query-native-tools declares tool_schemas and FlightRuntime.frozen_core_client_kwargs has no schema source without it, and because keeping it holds the tool block of every request identical to cell B0's. No execution plan authority, admission, scoring receipt or contact authority is created by this fragment; readiness is held and the coordinator flips it."
